<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Vœux de créneaux reçus</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:32px 16px;background:#F4F4F0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#000;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td align="center">
    <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#fff;">
      <tr><td style="padding:40px;background:#2C2C2C;color:#fff;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#D8EC95;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;">Espace Association</p><h1 style="margin:0;font-size:30px;">Vœux de créneaux reçus</h1></td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:40px;">
        <p>Bonjour {{ prenom }},</p>
        <p>La mairie de Feytiat a bien reçu les vœux de l'association <strong>{{ association.nom }}</strong> pour la campagne <strong>{{ campaign.seasonLabel }}</strong>. Ils sont <strong>en attente d'arbitrage par la mairie</strong> : vous serez informé des créneaux attribués.</p>
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:24px 0;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;font-size:14px;">
          <tr style="background:#F4F4F0;font-weight:bold;"><td style="padding:10px 12px;">Salle</td><td style="padding:10px 12px;">Créneau</td><td style="padding:10px 12px;">Activité</td></tr>
          {% for wish in wishes %}
            <tr style="border-top:1px solid #E5E5E0;">
              <td style="padding:10px 12px;">{{ wish.salle.nom }}</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px;">{{ wish.dayLabel }} {{ wish.startTime }}–{{ wish.endTime }}<br><span style="color:#61646B;">{{ wish.frequencyLabel }}</span></td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px;">{{ wish.activity }}<br><span style="color:#61646B;">{{ wish.audienceLabel }} · {{ wish.expectedAttendance }} pers.</span></td>
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </table>
        <p>Pour toute question, contactez les services de la mairie.</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:24px 40px;background:#000;color:#fff;font-size:12px;">Mairie de Feytiat — Plateforme Associations</td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
